0..72 Comment "// A C function whose pointer must not be null, bound to `Option<&int>`:"
73..143 Comment "// the niche\'s null owns nothing, and the function has no precondition"
144..214 Comment "// there, so the boundary check refuses the binding instead of a crash"
215..271 Comment "// finding it. The binding the niche meets is beside, in"
272..329 Comment "// `../../model/specification/niche-realizability.gandr`."
